<h1>New Student Enrollment</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @instructor.name %>,</p>

<p>Great news! A new student has enrolled in your course <strong><%= @course.title %></strong>.</p>

<p>Student Details:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Name: <%= @student.name %></li>
  <li>Email: <%= @student.email %></li>
  <li>Enrolled: <%= @enrollment.enrolled_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></li>
</ul>

<p>You can view your course details and track student progress:</p>
<p><%= link_to "View Course", @course_url %></p>

<p>Keep up the great work!</p>
<p>The Learning Platform Team</p>